  "summary_en": "Editorial introducing a Frontiers in Robotics and AI Research Topic on Responsible Robotics. It outlines ethical and social issues specific to robotics (bias, physical safety, privacy, deception, employment) and summarises contributions on privacy, accident investigation, social bias, a draft transparency standard, care-robot ethics and automation economics.",
